      "Language": "cze",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Radiosurgical hypophysectomy using Leksell gamma knife was performed to the patient with cancer pain from bone metastases of the breast cancer, relief of the pain was achieved. Patient survived 26 months after hypophysectomy. Review of the literature concerning relief of the pain after hypophysectomy is presented."},
